# Triage pointer

If this chat is **triage, oversight, routing, “what’s next”, or a done-check**
— follow [`docs/prompts/triage.md`](docs/prompts/triage.md) for the whole
session. Do not implement a leftover in that chat.

Implementation chats still follow the slice prompt named in `roadmap.md`
**Now** (one slice per chat). Do not invent a second plan.
